  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Purchase of milk for families/people in need</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2022 FESBAL and its 54 associated Food Banks received and distributed 17 million kilos of milk, which, for several reasons, are not available this year. But they are very necessary. Additionally, milk price has increased more than 30% this year due the inflation, ukranian crisis, etc, so the Food Banks can buy less milk with the same amount of donations. Also the donations have decreased due to the overall crisis, so in short there is no milk in the FB and its purchase its more expensive.</narrative>
  </description>
